[ti:1-03-推荐信]
[00:00.00]Dear Jack,
[00:01.00]As one of your closest friends,
[00:03.92]I’m writing the letter in purpose of recommending one of my favorite movies to you,
[00:11.65]Around the World in Eighty Days.
[00:14.67]The primary factors for my recommendation are as follows.
[00:20.16]For one thing,
[00:21.51]it is a movie of science fiction which tells us an exciting story about an English gentleman,
[00:30.13]Mr. Phileas Fogg,
[00:31.81]who makes a bet with his clubmates and managers to travel around the world in eighty days.
[00:40.11]For another,
[00:41.34]it gives us a vivid description of the difficulties and incidents which happen in his journey.
[00:50.19]Wish you enjoy the movie.
[00:52.54]Looking forward to your reply.
